---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'sw';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kuhusu Kraal Code — Historia na Dhamira Yetu"
  description="Chwezi Core Systems: watu wanaoelewa tatizo. Programu za biashara zilizojengwa kwa hali halisi za Kiafrika."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/sw/kampuni/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Njia ya mkate"><ol><li><a href="/sw/">Nyumbani</a></li><li aria-current="page">Kampuni</li></ol></nav>
      <h1>Ilijengwa na watu wanaoelewa tatizo</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Dhamira yetu</h2>
    <p>Mashirika ya Kiafrika yanastahili programu za biashara za kiwango cha dunia zinazoelewa hali zao halisi. Si bidhaa ya Magharibi iliyorekebishwa na tafsiri ya Kifaransa. Si chombo kilichobuniwa kwa masoko ambayo muunganisho unahakikishwa na mafunzo ni lazima.</p>
    <p>Kraal Code ulizaliwa kutoka imani hii: kila msimamizi wa ghala, kila meneja wa fedha, kila mkurugenzi mkuu, kila mwanafunzi wa uwanja anastahili mfumo anaweza kutumia siku ya kwanza — bila mafunzo, bila mshauri, bila cheti cha miliki.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>Misingi yetu ya muundo</h2>
    <div class="principles-grid">
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Matumizi si hiari</h3>
        <p>Kama mtumiaji angehitaji mwongozo kukamilisha kazi, kiolesura kinarekebishwa. Lengo: kiwango cha mafanikio yasiyosaidiwa ≥ 85%. Si kaulimbiu — ni kizuizi kinachodhibiti kila uamuzi wa muundo.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Usalama unawezesha, si kuzuia</h3>
        <p>Udhibiti wa usalama unawezesha kazi ya mbali, uwakilishaji na ushirikiano — bila kuacha uwajibikaji. Usalama ni mwezeshaji wa biashara, si kizuizi.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Hali halisi ya ndani inahesabika</h3>
        <p>Uganda si Kenya. Senegal si DRC. Kila nchi ina sarafu zake, kodi, mikataba, lugha. Kraal Code inabadilika kwa usanidi — si maendeleo maalum.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle-card">
        <h3>Ya kwamba kuhusu kilichopo</h3>
        <p>Hatuahisi tulichojenga. Vipengele vinavyoendelewa vinaonyeshwa kama ramani. Cheti zinazoendelewa zinaonyeshwa kama malengo. Hakuna vibandikio vya uwongo, hakuna ahadi za uwongo.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>Wasiliana nasi</h2><p>Tunajibu maswali yako kuhusu Kraal Code, Chwezi Core Systems na mbinu yetu.</p>
    <a href="/sw/mawasiliano/" class="btn btn--inverse">Wasiliana Nasi →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero{padding:var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12)}.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-4xl);max-width:800px}.breadcrumb ol{list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;gap:var(--kc-space-2);font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-6)}.breadcrumb a{color:var(--kc-teal);text-decoration:none}.breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after{content:'/';margin-left:var(--kc-space-2);color:var(--kc-text-tertiary)}.container--narrow{max-width:var(--kc-container-narrow)}.container--narrow p{font-size:var(--kc-text-base);color:var(--kc-text-secondary);line-height:var(--kc-leading-relaxed);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-4)}.principles-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:var(--kc-space-6);margin-top:var(--kc-space-8)}.principle-card{padding:var(--kc-space-6);background:var(--kc-surface-light);border:1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg)}.principle-card h3{font-size:var(--kc-text-lg);font-family:var(--kc-font-body);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);margin-bottom:var(--kc-space-2)}.principle-card p{font-size:var(--kc-text-sm);color:var(--kc-text-secondary)}.btn--inverse{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);font-weight:var(--kc-weight-semibold);font-size:var(--kc-text-base);border-radius:var(--kc-radius-lg);background:transparent;color:var(--kc-text-inverse);border:2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);transition:all var(--kc-transition-fast);text-decoration:none;margin-top:var(--kc-space-6)}.btn--inverse:hover{background:var(--kc-teal);border-color:var(--kc-teal)}@media(max-width:768px){.page-hero h1{font-size:var(--kc-text-3xl)}.principles-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
